    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/76/Vulko_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230306141415\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Vulko Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/76/Vulko_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230306141415\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"918\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Vulko Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Vulko_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> \n</p><p><b>半血驱魔师</b>\n</p><p>一个年轻的魔物猎人。她居住在一座古堡中，暗中保护人们免受魔物侵害，但她自己却是半吸血鬼半狼人。没有人知道她为何猎杀与自己同类的生物。\n\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821132338\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39613-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260821132338 and revision id 63196. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
